<h2 id=3D"interview-tip-1">Interview Tip</h2>
<p><em>Tip: Don=E2=80=99t waste time on complex proofs if it isn=E2=80=99t =
an important part of the interview.</em></p>
<p>During an interview, correctly deciphering the exact time of an algorith=
m like the one used to solve this problem isn't usually expected. In situat=
